          "slug": "disposable-email-service",
          "reason": "官方 FAQ 正文写明该服务是“temporary, completely anonymous email address that requires no registration”，来信“appear right under your mailbox address”即站内阅读，且“your personal data, the address itself and all emails are erased once you delete the mailbox”“mailbox stays valid until you delete it yourself”（站内邮件另保留 7 天），无身份签发、服务内收件箱与用户删除即销毁三项均可直接核对；官方 API 文档另写明“Create temporary email accounts and receive emails via REST API. No API key required.”并说明服务端接收并存储邮件。首页快照仅用于确认站点身份与标题（“Free Temporary Email, No Sign-Up”），不作为上述功能陈述的依据。",
